        "original_id": "0212dde9-234d-5cb5-805d-43abed350273",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Wilson, Leo, Ravi\n- Groups: Genesis, Stiltskin, VIXX LR, VIXX\n- Companies: Jellyfish Entertainment\n- Roles: vocalist, singer, songwriter, musical theatre actor, rapper\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Wilson was born on 8 September 1968 and is a Scottish musician.\n- Leo, whose birth name is Jung Taek-woon, was born on 10 November 1990 and is a South Korean singer, songwriter, and musical theatre actor.\n- Leo is signed under Jellyfish Entertainment.\n- Ray Wilson was the vocalist in the post-grunge band Stiltskin.\n- Ray Wilson was in Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\n- VIXX LR was established in August 2015.\n- VIXX LR consists of VIXX's main vocalist Leo and main rapper Ravi.",
